    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>Julie：</span></strong></em><span>一到年底，谁从我钱包偷钱了！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>阿蛮：</span></strong></em><span>很久没在外面吃过饭了......</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天这期是两个消费降级的人聊消费，试图花小钱过上品质生活。我不信只有我们消费降级了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 30一根的糖葫芦谁在买？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 非刚需不消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 比起给自己，更舍得给孩子买衣服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 一些奇怪的消费心理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 摆脱原生家庭，自己赚钱后的报复性消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 先用后付是巨大的消费陷阱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 去年消费最值得的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 怎么合理消费又能取悦自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">44:45</a> 消费理念会受家庭影响吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 开始影响父母的消费观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 如何养成理财观念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">01:02:00</a> 永远留一笔可以躺平两年的生活费&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
