  <item>
    <title>Vol.29丨朋友圈奇葩大赏，我从哪认识那么多装货！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694908830f2ae6a867833e48</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694908830f2ae6a867833e48</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Dec 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>Julie：</span></strong></em><span>朋友圈奇葩和装货太多了！不吐不快</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>阿蛮：</span></strong></em><span>朋友圈的同龄人都不爱分享了</span></p><span></span><p><span>我俩其实现在都不爱发朋友圈了， 比较主观地吐槽一下，纯属娱乐~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 我讨厌的朋友圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 装货AI哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 谁要看你老公和儿子的果照啊！（大笑音量预警）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 假名媛定制版朋友圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> 这些朋友圈爱看！多发！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 爱所有有生命力和正能量的内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 点赞评论算是一种社交</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a> 还会帮公司发朋友圈宣传吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> 谁的朋友圈不屏蔽分组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 大家为什么朋友圈可见时间越来越短，也越来越不爱发朋友圈？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">01:03:00</a> 发了朋友圈无人关注的失落&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">01:07:00</a> 朋友圈真的可能只为自己发吗？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友圈爱发就发，不爱发就不发，不被别人的目光和关注绑架，做自己就好，开心就好。</span></p>]]></description>
